@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
hide footbox
title US011 - to add a publication to my library.

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

actor User
participant ":MiteLovers" as System

User -> System : I want to add an item to my library
activate System
System --> User : Select what item you want to add
deactivate System
User -> System : itemId
activate System
System --> User : Done!
deactivate System

@enduml